# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course explores some of the most promising applications of quantum computing, including Hamiltonian simulation, optimization, machine learning, and differential equations. Each application is introduced through its theoretical motivation and then explored through hands-on case studies. We examine how real-world problems are mapped to quantum computers, which quantum techniques they use, and what evidence is needed to assess their potential.\n"
msgstr "Tinutuklas ng kursong ito ang ilan sa mga pinakamapagpapangakong aplikasyon ng quantum computing, kabilang ang Hamiltonian simulation, optimization, machine learning, at differential equations. Ipinakikilala ang bawat aplikasyon sa pamamagitan ng teoretikal na motibasyon nito at saka tinutuklas sa pamamagitan ng mga hands-on na case study. Tinitingnan natin kung paano imamapa ang mga real-world na problema sa mga quantum computer, anong mga quantum technique ang ginagamit nila, at anong ebidensya ang kailangan para masuri ang potensyal nila.\n"

